# No browser QA

Do not visually check work in the browser. Do not start, restart, or wait on `npm run showcase` / `python3 -m http.server`. Do not use browser tools, screenshots, or CDP for visual QA.

The user opens the showcase and will say if something is off.

This overrides the general “verify UI in the browser before declaring the task complete” workflow. Finish from code, then stop.

Only use the browser if the user explicitly asks to open or inspect the showcase.
